## Monorepo Filesystem Layout (STRICT)

```
/                                   <- repo root
  /backend                          <- .NET solution root
    FinanceCore.sln
    /src
      /FinanceCore.Api
      /FinanceCore.Application
      /FinanceCore.Domain
      /FinanceCore.Infrastructure
    /tests
      /FinanceCore.UnitTests
      /FinanceCore.IntegrationTests

  /frontend                         <- Angular workspace root
    angular.json
    orval.config.ts
    package.json
    tsconfig.json
    /src
      /app
        /api-client                 <- orval output — DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY
        /core
        /shared
        /features
        app.config.ts
